      "content": "It sounds incredibly exhausting to carry that weight every single day, and you deserve to have that pain acknowledged. Giving up on everything for good isn't the same as giving up on a temporary battle—it's a permanent solution to a temporary state, and that's a decision you don't have to make alone. Sometimes the bravest thing isn't to keep fighting, but to reach out and let someone else hold the rope for a while. You don't have to figure out the \"forever\" today; just try to get through the next hour, and let someone in to help you carry it.",
